Every task ends with running `mise run check` and a commit. Every test gets `t.Parallel()` unless it uses `t.Chdir`/`t.Setenv` (per `CLAUDE.md`). Use the existing `testutil` helpers if a test needs a git repo. No emoji in commit messages.

